# Scene 2, the turn: the rules buried as code in a constructor, a getter and a service lose their intent and can't be
# listed, tested or reused. Entities makes them first-class metadata, which everything else can read.
Import //reels/entities.reelpreset
Screen code

Output //.artifacts/reel/scenes/02-metadata.mp4
Set Viewport 1600x900
Set FontSize 19

Code //reels/code/Order.guarded.cs
Say "And it works. The rules are there: in the constructor,"
Focus lines 6-11
Mark "if (lines.Any(l => l.Price < 0))" 1
Callout "ArgumentException" "why? the intent is gone"
Say@over "in a property getter, [getter] where a check runs only in a debug build,"
Wait [getter]
Callout off
Focus lines 17-25
Mark "Debug.Assert(total >= 0)" 2
Callout "Debug.Assert(total >= 0)" "and not in Release"
Say@over "in a comment, [comment] and in a service somewhere else."
Wait [comment]
Callout off
Focus lines 27-32
Mark "// twice is fine?" 3
Focus lines 35-43
Mark "if (order.Version < stored.Version)" 4
Callout "if (order.Version < stored.Version)" "this service only"
Sleep 600ms
Callout off
Focus off
Say "But you can't list them. You can't test one on its own. Your API can't reuse them, and nothing can read them."
Say "Code hides a rule. Nothing makes it first class."
Mark off

Morph@ease-in-out,1400ms //examples/Nullean.Entities.Quickstart/OrderConstraints.cs
Say "Entities makes each rule a named value, declared once, next to the type."
Focus lines 7-8
Mark "TotalNeverNegative" 1
Say@over "Never negative. [idem] Cancelling twice is cancelling once."
Wait [idem]
Focus lines 22-26
Mark "CancelIsRepeatable" 2
Mark "VersionNeverGoesBack" 3
Focus off
Mark "[Constraints<Order>]" 4
Callout "[Constraints<Order>]" "a generator gathers every rule into one set"
Say "A source generator gathers them into one set. Now the rules are metadata."
Callout off
Mark off

Code@slide-left //reels/code/Readers.cs
Say "And metadata can be read by everything."
Focus lines 4-5
Say@over "The code that builds an order [built] gets a result, never an invalid order."
Wait [built]
Mark "rules.Validated(order)" 1
Focus lines 7-8
Say@over "An API [api] answers with problem details, keyed by field,"
Wait [api]
Mark "AddConstraintProblemDetails()" 2
Focus lines 10-11
Say@over "and the tests [tests] are one line."
Wait [tests]
Mark "AutoTest.For(OrderConstraints.Instance, Orders).RunAsync()" 3
Focus off
Say@skeptic "Written once. Read by everything."
Mark off
Sleep 300ms
